# INVWINR.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the menus at
# level 1, File > Log out, the menus at level 2, and the end by
# File > Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINR.SNP is its snapshot.
T READER
K TAB
T Reader1986
K ENTER
S READER
K ALT-F L
S LOGOUT
K STAB
T CLERK
K TAB
T Clerk1986
K ENTER
S CLERK
K ALT-F X
S GONE
